{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003470/extras/81d432178468f6cbb5e63dfe93e03a70.poster.avif?t=1766261443\" aria-label=\"Jump Ability\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003470/extras/81d432178468f6cbb5e63dfe93e03a70.webm?t=1766261443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003470/extras/81d432178468f6cbb5e63dfe93e03a70.mp4?t=1766261443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solid Liquid Gas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Solid Liquid Gas</i> is an atmospheric <strong>exploration adventure</strong> about a fox searching for its lost memories after death. Guided only by fragments of the past, you journey through environments shaped by shifting weather: snow, rain, and dust storms. each tied to a different state of being.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will step into the quiet paws of a fox who awakens without memory, drifting between life and death. On a journey to the afterlife, you must uncover fragments of a forgotten past while confronting the fears that once held you captive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003470/extras/f7e6cd720e14493444a9afd6fa54a54c.poster.avif?t=1766261443\" aria-label=\"Fox hanging between life and death\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003470/extras/f7e6cd720e14493444a9afd6fa54a54c.webm?t=1766261443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003470/extras/f7e6cd720e14493444a9afd6fa54a54c.mp4?t=1766261443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Emotional Journey of Memory and Fear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the fox\u2019s life by collecting lost memories scattered across mysterious landscapes. Each memory reveals more of who you once were and what you must face to move forward. Overcome deep rooted fears in the form of wolves, predators, and shadows of the past. Survival is not about strength, but courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003470/extras/d714198ce4fec7cec9896dacd52d32a6.poster.avif?t=1766261443\" aria-label=\"Collecting Memory Fragments\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003470/extras/d714198ce4fec7cec9896dacd52d32a6.webm?t=1766261443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003470/extras/d714198ce4fec7cec9896dacd52d32a6.mp4?t=1766261443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beautifully Crafted Landscapes to Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse forests, frozen rivers, and golden fields as the world shifts between solid ground, liquid waters, and gaseous skies. Every environment reflects a state of being grounded, flowing, or fleeting and hides secrets that echo the fox\u2019s story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003470/extras/41c56bb92abf045df5c9faa8b9c43a82.poster.avif?t=1766261443\" aria-label=\"one of the discomforting memories\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003470/extras/41c56bb92abf045df5c9faa8b9c43a82.webm?t=1766261443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003470/extras/41c56bb92abf045df5c9faa8b9c43a82.mp4?t=1766261443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Journey Through Shifting Weather</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snow, rain, and dust storms shape the fox\u2019s path, each weather carrying fragments of memory. Every step forward is marked by the changing sky, where silence, sound, and storm weave together into the rhythm of its journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003470/extras/4560e42998d691ab1032680a0d6f3a24.avif?t=1766261443\" alt=\"Death of the wolf\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003470/extras_big/4560e42998d691ab1032680a0d6f3a24.webp?t=1766261443 width=1560 height=442 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Meditative Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather than rushing forward, it invites you to slow down and take in every moment. It\u2019s a journey less about reaching the end, and more about feeling the weight of each fleeting memory found along the way.<br><br>Players will explore open landscapes, uncover hidden memories, and piece together the fox\u2019s story on the path to the afterlife. The world reacts to changing weather, creating challenges and opportunities that shape how you travel and what you discover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration Driven Gameplay</strong>\u00a0- Wander through forests, rivers, deserts, and forgotten ruins in search of lost fragments of memory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Weather as Gameplay</strong>\u00a0- Experience three elemental states:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solid</strong>: snow freezes rivers, opening new paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liquid</strong>: rain floods terrain, reshaping the journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gas</strong>: dust storms obscure the world and test your navigation.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Discovery</strong>\u00a0- Uncover the fox\u2019s past piece by piece through environmental storytelling rather than dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Art and Sound</strong>\u00a0- A beautiful visual style and immersive soundscape bring the environments to life.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Journey of Reflection</strong>\u00a0- No combat, no timers - only exploration, memory, and meaning. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4003470?t=1766261443","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4003470?t=1766261443","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003470/d8b791a42e19f4158a311ed913255b4647c34554/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766261443","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003470/d8b791a42e19f4158a311ed913255b4647c34554/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766261443","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vi