tes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solid</strong>: snow freezes rivers, opening new paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liquid</strong>: rain floods terrain, reshaping the journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gas</strong>: dust storms obscure the world and test your navigation.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Discovery</strong>\u00a0- Uncover the fox\u2019s past piece by piece through environmental storytelling rather than dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Art and Sound</strong>\u00a0- A beautiful visual style and immersive soundscape bring the environments to life.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Journey of Reflection</strong>\u00a0- No combat, no timers - only exploration, memory, and meaning. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["ShadowBITE Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003470/eed7b8549185b6c5871df3dc49e6d48fef7e4eb0/header.jpg?t=1766261443","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4003470/1694611462/9a534d8ef20be71c548d5516367dee90f9f51520/1756845516/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758119937","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4003470/1694611462/9a534d8ef20be71c548d5516367dee90f9f51520/1756845516/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758119937","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_traile